              {"number": 10, "prompt": "Surya Kund (1026) — Steps on the _______ produce a geometric pattern.", "answer": ["four sides", "4 sides"], "wordLimit": 2, "explanation": "The Surya Kund has 'four sides of steps that descend to the bottom in a stunning geometrical formation'.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p1", "ref": "I", "quote": "including four sides of steps that descend to the bottom in a stunning geometrical formation"}},
