              {"number": 15, "prompt": "Paragraph B", "answer": "iii",  "explanation": "Paragraph B explains industrial relocation meaning goods travel hundreds or thousands of kilometres — changes affecting distances goods are transported.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p2", "ref": "B", "quote": "the production site is hundreds or even thousands of kilometres away from the final assembly plant or away from users"}},
