              {"number": 17, "prompt": "Paragraph D", "answer": "i",   "explanation": "Paragraph D presents sustainable development as a fresh, important long-term goal with a 2040 horizon.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p2", "ref": "D", "quote": "a new imperative — sustainable development — offers an opportunity for adapting the EU's common transport policy"}},
