              {"number": 25, "prompt": "The Gothenburg European Council was set up 30 years ago.", "answer": "NOT GIVEN", "explanation": "The passage mentions the Gothenburg European Council but gives no information about when it was established.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p2", "ref": "D", "quote": "This objective, agreed by the Gothenburg European Council"}},
