              {"number": 27, "prompt": "The availability of novels has depended on _______ for so long.", "answer": "B", "explanation": "Novels evolved through 'technological developments that made it possible to print out huge numbers of texts' — mass production.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "2", "quote": "the novel has evolved precisely because of technological developments that made it possible to print out huge numbers of texts"}},
