              {"number": 34, "prompt": "According to the writer, the 'displacement effect' on the visitor is caused by", "options": [{"key": "A", "text": "the variety of works on display and the way they are arranged."}, {"key": "B", "text": "the impossibility of viewing particular works of art over a long period."}, {"key": "C", "text": "the similar nature of the paintings and the lack of great works."}, {"key": "D", "text": "the inappropriate nature of the individual works selected for exhibition."}], "answer": "A", "explanation": "The displacement effect arises from 'diverse paintings, drawings and sculptures brought together in an environment for which they were not originally created'.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "7", "quote": "the strangeness of seeing such diverse paintings, drawings and sculptures brought together in an environment for which they were not originally created"}},
