              {"number": 6,  "prompt": "Tourism contributes over six per cent of the Australian gross national product.", "answer": "NOT GIVEN", "explanation": "The passage gives a 6% global figure but never mentions Australia specifically.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p1", "ref": "C", "quote": "producing over 6 per cent of the world's national product"}},
