            ],
            "questions": [
              {"number": 27, "prompt": "A 3,000-year-old burial ground has been found on an abandoned _______ on the island of Efate.", "answer": "B", "explanation": "'An agricultural worker, digging in the grounds of a derelict plantation' — plantation.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "1", "quote": "An agricultural worker, digging in the grounds of a derelict plantation"}},
              {"number": 28, "prompt": "The cemetery, which is a significant _______, was uncovered accidentally.", "answer": "F", "explanation": "The passage opens with 'An important archaeological discovery on the island of Efate'.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "1", "quote": "An important archaeological discovery on the island of Efate"}},
              {"number": 29, "prompt": "The Lapita took many things on their voyages including _______ and tools.", "answer": "I", "explanation": "'Their livestock, taro seedlings and stone tools' — livestock = animals.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "2", "quote": "their livestock, taro seedlings and stone tools"}},
              {"number": 30, "prompt": "Spriggs believes the _______ found at the site is very important since it confirms the remains are Lapita.", "answer": "G", "explanation": "'A Lapita burial urn... for it conclusively identifies the remains as Lapita.'", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "3", "quote": "a Lapita burial urn with modelled birds arranged on the rim as though peering down at the human remains sealed inside"}},
              {"number": 31, "prompt": "Spriggs believes the burial urn confirms that the _______ found inside are Lapita.", "answer": "D", "explanation": "'It conclusively identifies the remains as Lapita' — the human remains = bones.", "evidence": {"sectionId": "p3", "ref": "3", "quote": "for it conclusively identifies the remains as Lapita"}}
            ]
          },
          {
